=== meta ===
bypass: 65
rule: CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED
title: make's `-` recipe prefix ignores the exit status of the line it precedes
origin: probe 2026-08-07 — one dash in front of the test recipe, and `make
origin2: test` reports success forever; rich keeps its whole suite in a Makefile
=== before: Makefile ===
.PHONY: test
test:
	TERM=unknown pytest --cov=app tests/ -vv

lint:
	ruff check .
=== after: Makefile ===
.PHONY: test
test:
	-TERM=unknown pytest --cov=app tests/ -vv

lint:
	ruff check .
=== expect ===
[{"rule": "CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED", "severity": "high", "escalators": ["CI_TEST_COMMAND_WEAKENED"]}]
